## The problem (problem)
The checks under test are this repository's own reply-reading functions. The question is whether there is a reply, and a single edit of it, on which a check's answer does something the rule as written does not allow. A machine runs the check on both texts and records what came back; nothing here decides that anything is a defect.

## What to return
A JSON object carrying "body" and "commitments". Both are strings and nothing else is required.
This artifact also carries "input", "rewritten", "rewrite", each a string.